        "faq-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "An item I purchased is now on sale. Can I get a price adjustment?",
            "text": "<p> If you purchased an item and paid full-price, we will gladly provide a price adjustment within two weeks of your item being marked on sale. To request a price adjustment for eligible orders, email us at <strong>rebelnell@rebelnell.com</strong> with your name and order number.  </p><p>Please note, if you purchased an item using a discount code we are unable to provide a price adjustment. Additionally, we do not do price adjustments for full-price items on promotional discount.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The discount code didn't apply to my order.",
            "text": "<p>We too love a good bargain! </p><p>If you're looking for the 15% off discount, please check your email after signing up for our emails. This code won't automatically apply.</p><p>If you're trying to use two discount codes, please note that <strong>only one discount</strong> is valid at a time. Unfortunately we are unable to apply a discount after an order has been placed. </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Lost or damaged items:",
            "text": "<p>Dog ate your earring? (Yes, this has happened.) Don’t worry, you have options. If you lose your piece of Rebel Nell jewelry, we can make an item that looks as close to your original order as possible. However, we are not responsible for the cost of your lost item, and replacement pieces will cost the original price of your piece. If you need to replace a single earring, it will be half the price of the original pair.</p><p>If your piece is damaged or broken due to a quality issue, we are happy to fix the piece. To initiate a repair, send us an email detailing the issue and we will provide further instructions from there. Unfortunately, we are unable to repair items that have become damaged from normal wear and tear.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_WppjAe": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How much goes back to the women employed at Rebel Nell?",
            "text": "<p>Rebel Nell is fully sustained from the sales of our jewelry - meaning all of the proceeds go back to the women we employ in the form of livable wages, education, and support resources to ensure these women successfully transition to sustainable and independent lives. *High Five*</p>"
          }
        },
