            "title": "Do you scrape the graffiti off walls?",
            "text": "<p>No! We only collect the paint after it has fallen. However, when organizations like The Detroit Riverfront, Eastern Market, and The Alley Project need to clean a wall for a new mural, they scrape the paint and bring it to us.  </p>"
