        "question_CnBYKe": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How can I care for my jewelry?",
            "text": "<p>To keep your jewelry clean, we recommend wiping it down with a polishing cloth or gentle fabric. Avoid using harsh cleaning agents, as your Rebel Nell jewelry is delicate!</p><p>We recommend removing your jewelry before excessive exposure to sun, water, and various chemicals. Avoid wearing jewelry for a day to the beach, excessive dish washing, long showers, etc. When getting ready, we would encourage you to put your jewelry on after your perfume and hairspray as the chemicals can dull the resin.</p><p>If your piece is tarnishing we are happy to give it a fresh polish, but please note that Rebel Nell will not be held responsible for any damages that may occur by foregoing the above recommendations.</p>"
          }
        },
